---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Expedition - October | Cerro Baúl | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="The Fortress of Human Architecture">
  <Header />

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-header hero-bg-overlay" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,14,0.7), var(--bg-dark)), url('/images/evento-presencial.png');">
      <div class="container text-center scroll-reveal">
        <a href="/en/eventos-presenciales/" class="back-link">← Back to Annual Program</a>
        <h1 class="page-title text-gradient-flame" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Field Expedition - October | Cerro Baúl</h1>
        <p class="lead">The Fortress of Human Architecture</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container text-content-box glass-panel breathing-glow">
        
        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Climate & Season</h3>
          <p>Spring in the southern desert. The climate in Moquegua is temperate and perpetually sunny, ideal for ascending the demanding, monumental plateau without the extreme heat of the lower coast nor the freezing cold of the high altiplano.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);">Brief Mystical History</h3>
          <p>An awe-inspiring chest-shaped mountain that protects a pre-Inca fortified citadel atop its sheer flat summit. It was the southernmost strategic bastion of the Wari empire, who coexisted peacefully at the base with the Tiwanaku in a remarkable display of territorial balance and diplomacy. It is revered as a guardian Apu of boundless abundance. In Andean cosmology, Cerro Baúl is a high-ranking tutelar Apu—a living, conscious entity guarding the region. Its flat summit is considered a supreme "Huaca" or sacred sanctuary, an immense natural altar elevated between heaven and earth.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Subjects of Work</h3>
          <p>Cerro Baúl represents pure geometric stability, the sacred engineering of boundaries, order, and physical manifest density. It serves as the ultimate stage to develop genuine PERSONAL ACHIEVEMENT. Here, the student disentangles ancestral family lineage conditioning from their true original divine blueprint. Utilizing numbers, the student constructs an unshakeable infrastructure for earthly material projects, unlocking Achievement free from karmic distortion.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Inquire Dates on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background-position: center; background-size: cover; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .back-link { color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .text-content-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: -3rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: left; }
  .detail-block { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-block h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .detail-block p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
